<pdd-reason>Expose metadata validation through a bounded JSON stdin/file CLI.</pdd-reason>
<pdd-version>0.1.0</pdd-version>
% Deliverable: src/main.rs only; library dependency lib_rust.prompt.
Implement physics-contracts validate [FILE|-], stdin by default. Limit reads to
MAX_INPUT_BYTES+1 before calling the library's validator. JSON stdout always
states the library's assurance boundary. Exit 0 for record_valid, 2 for invalid
input, unknown command, unreadable input or exceeded size. Do not silently ignore
extra arguments; do not open artifact/source references or execute commands.
Preserve a Rust-only runtime. Independent tests exercise the actual binary.
